4?t=1741479320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Adventure:</u> Explore and Conquer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The motherboard is a hostile, ever-evolving world determined to protect its core. Adapt to its challenges and forge your own path to victory where every decision could mean the difference between survival and critical system failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309740/extras/1a8327427cdce2d251781f3c03f6d44f.poster.avif?t=1741479320\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309740/extras/1a8327427cdce2d251781f3c03f6d44f.webm?t=1741479320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309740/extras/1a8327427cdce2d251781f3c03f6d44f.mp4?t=1741479320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Abilities:</u> Superpowered Nanobot</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness your Bit-powered abilities to navigate  your journey and determine your progress while you destroy, discover, and unlock the motherboard's deepest secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309740/extras/837d54d44ce681792766810b97eacd15.poster.avif?t=1741479320\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309740/extras/837d54d44ce681792766810b97eacd15.webm?t=1741479320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309740/extras/837d54d44ce681792766810b97eacd15.mp4?t=1741479320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Strategic Gameplay:</u> Play Your Way!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your approach and carefully manage your resources, adapt to the motherboard's challenges, and outsmart its defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309740/extras/c88e11f032532caa56e774c145cf90f1.poster.avif?t=1741479320\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309740/extras/c88e11f032532caa56e774c145cf90f1.webm?t=1741479320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309740/extras/c88e11f032532caa56e774c145cf90f1.mp4?t=1741479320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Motherbored is a sci-fi, open-world action-adventure set within a sentient computer universe. Harness Bit powered abilities, battle the systems defenses, explore, strategize, and survive in this electrifying computer realm.",
